1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Nobody taught the first humans how to make babies.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,650
No books. No internet.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,600
So how did they ALL figure it out?

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,580
The answer is hiding in your brain.

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,650
Look. Three hundred thousand years ago.

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,150
The first humans. No manual.

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,250
No teachers. And yet... here you are.

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,050
Penguins? Never taught. Elephants? Never taught.

9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,750
Every animal just KNOWS. It's called instinct.

10
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,750
Pre-installed software in your brain.

11
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,350
And your brain literally rewards you for following it.

12
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,650
Forty thousand year old cave paintings prove they understood everything.

13
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,900
Meanwhile, you can't even build IKEA furniture without a tutorial.

14
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,450
But here's the insane part.

15
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,050
Your parents figured it out. Their parents did.

16
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,150
Ten thousand generations in a row.

17
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,000
If even ONE had failed... you would not exist.

18
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,760
Your DNA has been practicing for three point eight... BILLION... years.
